 testPendingHelpers;r;req;db;con;st;pending;state;iter;out;msg
⍝ Test high-level pending helpers in isolation

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test Pending Helpers API'

db←open':memory:'
con←connect db

⍝ Success path
(st pending)←preparePending(con 'SELECT i FROM range(5000) t(i)')
r,←⊂'preparePending success status'req DuckDBSuccess=st
r,←⊂'preparePending returned pointer'req pending≠0

:If (DuckDBSuccess=st)∧pending≠0
    state←pendingCheckState pending
    r,←⊂'pendingCheckState enum valid'req state∊0 1 2 3

    iter←0
    :While (~api.duckdb_pending_execution_is_finished state)∧iter<100000
        state←api.duckdb_pending_execute_task pending
        iter+←1
    :EndWhile
    r,←⊂'pending execution finished'req api.duckdb_pending_execution_is_finished state

    (st out)←api.duckdb_execute_pending pending 6
    r,←⊂'execute_pending success status'req DuckDBSuccess=st
    :If DuckDBSuccess=st
        {}api.duckdb_destroy_result ⊂out
    :EndIf
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_pending pending
:EndIf

⍝ Error path
(st pending)←preparePending(con 'SELECT * FROM definitely_missing_table_xyz')
r,←⊂'preparePending prepare-error status'req DuckDBError=st
r,←⊂'preparePending prepare-error has null pointer'req pending=0

:If pending≠0
    state←pendingCheckState pending
    iter←0
    :While (~api.duckdb_pending_execution_is_finished state)∧iter<1000
        state←api.duckdb_pending_execute_task pending
        iter+←1
    :EndWhile
    msg←pendingError pending
    r,←⊂'pendingError message exists on failure'req 0<≢msg
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_pending pending
:EndIf

{}disconnect con
{}close db
⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Pending helpers testing complete!'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
